# Package collection signing material. generate_collection.sh takes the private key by
# path from this directory, so without these rules a run of the script invites committing
# the signing key. Nothing here is ever needed by a consumer: they only need collection.json
# and the certificates, which are public.
key.pem
key_rsa.pem
private.pem
*.p12
*.csr
*.certSigningRequest

# Intermediate written by generate_collection.sh and deleted by it on success. Ignored so an
# interrupted run does not leave an unsigned collection staged.
collection_unsigned.json

# macOS
.DS_Store
